# Build context = Dockerfile inputs only: pyproject.toml, poetry.lock,
# README.md, the post-conventions spec and the scholar_lens package (including
# the deployment's scholar_lens/configs/config.yaml, read by the job at runtime).
*
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock
!README.md
!assets/post_conventions.yml
!scholar_lens/
scholar_lens/**/__pycache__
scholar_lens/**/*.py[cod]
